  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Vẽ đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét gốc tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta thấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>∉</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, miền nghiệm của bất phương trình là nửa mặt phẳng không kể bờ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, không chứa gốc toạ độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> (miền không gạch sọc hình bên).</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/9c7a13074